Description: Fits pseudo-Bayesian Model Averaging (pBMA) and Bayesian Stacking ensembles of lineal meta-models,
    while explicitly accounting for the prediction errors of the individual models. When native 
    uncertainty estimates are unavailable, it provides tools to estimate heteroscedastic 
    errors via Local Polynomial Regression (LOESS). The meta-model space is explored 
    using exhaustive search or a Markov Chain Monte Carlo Model Composition (MC3) algorithm 
    powered by 'brms'.
